[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18726.07, "timestamp": "05:12:06", "text": "它们确实不一样，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18733.23, "timestamp": "05:12:13", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18741.19, "timestamp": "05:12:21", "text": "但我拿到这张皮肤后就再也没用过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18748.19, "timestamp": "05:12:28", "text": "上帝。哦，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18751.39, "timestamp": "05:12:31", "text": "真倒霉。铁盒。是的，铁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18754.948, "timestamp": "05:12:34", "text": "积木。所以我的图形车，感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18757.628, "timestamp": "05:12:37", "text": "感觉就像一块熨斗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18761.35, "timestamp": "05:12:41", "text": "因为太热了，所以用盒子装起来。即使开空调"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18764.868, "timestamp": "05:12:44", "text": "已经持续多少小时了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18765.948, "timestamp": "05:12:45", "text": "我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18768.39, "timestamp": "05:12:48", "text": "知道。我已经不知道有多少个了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18775.91, "timestamp": "05:12:55", "text": "顺便说一句，这很糟糕，因为"}]